== Release audit update — 2026-09-19 ==

A final stacked rendering audit found three MediaWiki presentation defects in Wave 2:

* [[Knowledge representation/Simple]] used Markdown blockquote syntax;
* [[Ontology/Simple]] used Markdown blockquote syntax;
* [[Schema]] used Markdown blockquote syntax.

All three were converted to explicit <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code> markup without changing the underlying claims.

The standards check was repeated against current W3C publications:

* RDF 1.2 Concepts and Abstract Data Model remains a Candidate Recommendation Snapshot dated 7 April 2026;
* RDF 1.2 Semantics remains a Candidate Recommendation Snapshot dated 7 April 2026;
* RDF 1.2 Primer is a Draft Note dated 26 August 2026;
* OWL 2 remains the W3C Recommendation family dated 11 December 2012.

Wave 2 remains '''20 concepts / 60 reader surfaces'''. No semantic-definition changes were required by the release audit.

Common public search aliases <code>RDF</code> and <code>OWL</code> were added as Navigation-classified redirects to the canonical [[Resource Description Framework]] and [[Web Ontology Language]] pages. They do not create additional knowledge-object identities.

